 "_doc": "massing: weights for upper-floor shapes (podium: tower on a base, step: set back on one or two sides, wing: a low part beside a taller block, none). Building site types for BuildingGen. layout: room-partition algorithm + params. zones: room kinds per security zone \u2014 entrance (room at the main door), small (\u226416 cells), large (\u226560 cells), rotation (by size rank), and layout-kind mappings (e.g. living/bedroom from corridor_units). density: default cover density. exterior: wall material index (0 plaster, 1 concrete, 2 steel). enter_corridor: put the main door on a corridor. networked: false = no NET even with devices. no_corridors: never relabel long thin rooms as corridors. levels: how many security levels (L1..L4) the building uses, counted from its base level. net_chance: chance a non-target building of this type has a NET (targets always do). windows: chance per eligible exterior wall square of a window. shapes: weights for footprint shapes (rect, L, U, T, chamfer, courtyard). decay: default ruin level 0-1.",
